      "sourceTextSha256": "ec4fcd426569130032d446d7f85a4335208460bff1eecafcb021bc60d7733985",
      "text": "Day 9 · Early pick-up at the hotel (approx. 7:20–8:20 am, depending on the area) for the Argentine side of the falls, one of the New Seven Wonders of Nature, with the Lower Circuit, the Upper Circuit and the Devil’s Throat, including the Ecological Jungle Train.\n\nLower Circuit · 1,700 metres of walkways into the jungle, close to the Dos Hermanas, Chico and Ramírez falls, down to the foot of the Salto Bossetti (approx. 1 h 45, medium difficulty). Upper Circuit · 1,300 metres of elevated walkways along the edge of several major falls (approx. 1 hour, easy). Devil’s Throat · The Ecological Train leads to a 1,000-metre walkway to the grandiose Devil’s Throat.\n\nNautical adventure & photo safari\n\nIguazú · Day 9\n\nPrice on request\n\nAdditional activities within Iguazú National Park.",
